# Firmware configuration headers

`secrets.example.h` is the tracked contract. Copy it to `secrets.h` and fill
Wi-Fi, a unique recovery-AP password, provisioned device ID/secret, HTTPS
backend URL and issuing root CA.
`secrets.h` is ignored and must never be committed or attached to test logs.

The firmware intentionally rejects non-HTTPS backend URLs, device secrets
shorter than 20 characters, and recovery passwords outside 12-63 characters.
See `../README.md` and
`../../docs/hardware/HARDWARE_TELEMETRY.md` for provisioning and rotation.
